{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17083","headline":"寒夜闻霜钟 · 郑絪","name":"寒夜闻霜钟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜钟初应律，寂寂出重林。\n拂水宜清听，凌空散逈音。\n舂容时未歇，摇曳夜方深。\n月下和虚籁，风前间远砧。\n净兼寒漏彻，闲畏曙更侵。\n遥想千山外，泠泠何处寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑絪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17083.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17083","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}